  ]);
});

app.listen(3000, () => {
  console.log('Server running on port 3000');
});

module.exports = app;
```

4. **Never commit secrets to version control**, even canary tokens. Use proper secret management.

The most urgent issues are the missing package.json and the exposure of credentials in the .env.test file.

